{"id":"afba846451d1e711","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"ω-Consistency","display":"df-omega-consistency — ω-Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["90-df-omega-consistency"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — ω-Consistency","depends_on":["[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-omega-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — ω-Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的有限演算，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-规则扩充演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (one-free-variable formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\neg\\Bigl(\nT\\vdash\\exists v\\,\\varphi(v)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\neg\\Bigl(\nT\\vdash\\exists v\\,\\varphi(v)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致的</li>\n<li>不存在一个公式，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明它有见证，同时又对每个标准数码逐一证明其否定。</li>\n<li>它排除演算上的矛盾；与本书使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=(0=S0)\">\\(\\bot=(0=S0)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 相联系时，需另有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7defeb7e3c558655\" href=\"?note=7defeb7e3c558655\" title=\"90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger\">90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger</a>。</li>\n<li>Gödel原版不完备性定理需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$\\vdash$ 是 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的有限演算，不是 $\\omega$-规则扩充演算。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ (one-free-variable formula, see [[90-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline n$ (numeral, see [[90-df-numeral]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger","status":"resolved","id":"7defeb7e3c558655","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"它排除演算上的矛盾；与本书使用 $\\bot=(0=S0)$ 的 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 相联系时，需另有 $T\\vdash\\neg\\bot$，见 [[90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\neg\\Bigl(\nT\\vdash\\exists v\\,\\varphi(v)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0383e348990de99","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对包含足够初等算术的通常理论，$\\omega$-一致性蕴含 1-一致性，1-一致性蕴含一致性（see [[90-df-omega-consistency]]）。"},{"id":"7defeb7e3c558655","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$ 见 [[90-df-omega-consistency]]，$\\bot=(0=S0)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[90-df-consistency-statement]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-omega-consistency]]、[[90-df-1-consistency]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\